hkJ.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/UWFTH8U.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/xihe1Iq.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/mttOKJb.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/1S9UjyX.png\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/8U6EqW7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"44\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/EY1Banv.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"35\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/pRShE0c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/ajOKaqG.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"46\" height=\"26\"><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://imgur.com/1h9o2Kx.png\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>📖 關於</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Spawner Control 是一個<strong>伺服器端</strong>模組，可讓您使用設定檔來調整怪物生成器方塊的各項功能。自訂生成頻率、經驗值掉落、數量限制等更多參數。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"color:#f00\"><strong>⚠️ 注意：</strong>若您原本使用的是 <strong>v1.1</strong> 版本並已升級至 <strong>v1.2</strong>，請務必<strong>刪除原有的設定檔</strong>以避免發生衝突。</span><span style=\"color:#f00\"><br></span></span></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/938u6RR.gif\" alt=\"Preview1\"></span></th>\n<th style=\"text-align:center\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/lUGbNIF.gif\" alt=\"Preview2\"></span></p>\n</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n</table>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://imgur.com/1h9o2Kx.png\">⚙️ 設定選項</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">探索並微調設定檔中的選項，以符合您的需求：</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Dplayend/Spawner-Control/wiki/Config#ignorerestrictions\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code>ignoreRestrictions</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Dplayend/Spawner-Control/wiki/Config#spawnLimit\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code>spawnLimit</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Dplayend/Spawner-Control/wiki/Config#spawnLimitValue\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code>spawnLimitValue</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Dplayend/Spawner-Control/wiki/Config#dropXp\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code>dropXp</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Dplayend/Spawner-Control/wiki/Config#dropXpValue\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code>dropXpValueBase</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Dplayend/Spawner-Control/wiki/Config#dropXpValue\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code>dropXpValueAdd1</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Dplayend/Spawner-Control/wiki/Config#dropXpValue\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code>dropXpValueAdd2</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Dplayend/Spawner-Control/wiki/Config#spawnCount\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code>spawnCount</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Dplayend/Spawner-Control/wiki/Config#spawnRange\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code>spawnRange</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Dplayend/Spawner-Control/wiki/Config#spawnDelay\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code>spawnDelay</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Dplayend/Spawner-Control/wiki/Config#minspawndelay--maxspawndelay\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code>minSpawnDelay</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Dplayend/Spawner-Control/wiki/Config#minspawndelay--maxspawndelay\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code>maxSpawnDelay</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Dplayend/Spawner-Control/wiki/Config#playerrange\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code>playerRange</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Dplayend/Spawner-Control/wiki/Config#maxnearbyentities\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code>maxNearbyEntities</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Dplayend/Spawner-Control/wiki/Config#maxnearbyentities\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code>lootDropType</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Dplayend/Spawner-Control/wiki/Config#lootdropchance\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code>lootDropChance</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Dplayend/Spawner-Control/wiki/Config#lootdroplist\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code>lootDropList</code></a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://imgur.com/1h9o2Kx.png\">❓ 常見問題</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>問：Spawner Control 是客戶端還是伺服器端模組？</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"> <strong>答：</strong>它是伺服器端模組，但您也可以將其放入客戶端的 mods 資料夾中</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>問：我可以將 Spawner Control 納入我的模組整合包（Modpack）嗎？</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"> <strong>答：</strong>可以！只需正確標示該模組，並將其列入相關專案中即可。</span></p>",
